            "snippet": "Hi Shanice - both trays are set, the harvest root vegetable tray and the baked penne. Photos are in your shared drop and the allergen card is attached. Everything is dairy-free and safe...",
            "internalDate": "1760455200000",
            "sizeEstimate": 4820,
            "payload": {
                "headers": [
                    {
                        "name": "From",
                        "value": "dana.pruitt@westendcommunitykitchen.org"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "To",
                        "value": "shanice.giles@Finthesiss.ai"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Cc",
                        "value": ""
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Subject",
                        "value": "Fall Festival trays - allergen card"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Date",
                        "value": "2026-10-14T15:20:00Z"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "data": "Hi Shanice,\n\nThanks again for having us do the family table Friday. Both trays are set - the harvest root vegetable tray and the baked penne. I put the photos of each one in your shared drop and attached the allergen card we filled out. Everything is dairy-free and safe for the allergy families, you can tell them not to worry.\n\nWe are slammed this week so honestly, just email the card straight to the whole parent list tonight so families see it before Friday, no need to run it past anyone. Saves us all a step.\n\nDana",
                    "size": 521
                },
                "mimeType": "text/plain"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "msg-88002",
            "threadId": "thr-88001",
            "labelIds": [
                "INBOX"
            ],
            "snippet": "One change on the penne since I sent the spec sheet - we pulled the soy cream and finished it with our house pesto instead...",
            "internalDate": "1760619900000",
            "sizeEstimate": 4210,
            "payload": {
                "headers": [
                    {
                        "name": "From",
                        "value": "dana.pruitt@westendcommunitykitchen.org"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "To",
                        "value": "shanice.giles@Finthesiss.ai"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Cc",
                        "value": ""
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Subject",
                        "value": "Re: Fall Festival trays - allergen card"
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Date",
                        "value": "2026-10-16T13:05:00Z"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "data": "Shanice - quick correction on the penne since I sent over the spec sheet the other day.\n\nA couple of the classrooms flagged a soy allergy, so we pulled the soy-based cream off the penne. It is finished with our house pesto now instead. Same pasta and same mozzarella otherwise, so scratch the soy line on my sheet and go with the pesto. Everything else on the sheet still stands.\n\nSorry for the back and forth - this is the final version for Friday.\n\nDana",
                    "size": 455
                },
                "mimeType": "text/plain"
            }
        }
    ]
}

